\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. TO God, the only Wise,
\par Our Saviour and our King,
\par Let all the saints below the skies
\par Their humble praises bring.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. 'Tis His almighty love,
\par His counsels, and His care,
\par Preserve us safe from sin and death,
\par And every hurtful snare.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He will present our souls,
\par Umblemished and complete,
\par Before the glory of His face,
\par With joys divinely great.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Then all the chosen seed
\par Shall meet arround the throne,
\par Shall bless the conduct of His grace,
\par And make His wonders known.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

